WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:05.720 --> 00:00:06.720
&gt;&gt; Tucker: GOOD EVENING.

00:00:06.721 --> 00:00:08.488
WELCOME TO "TUCKER CARLSON

00:00:08.489 --> 00:00:08.855
TONIGHT."

00:00:08.856 --> 00:00:10.023
THE WAR HAS BEEN POSTPONED, IT

00:00:10.024 --> 00:00:10.724
TURNS OUT.

00:00:10.725 --> 00:00:14.861
A DAY AFTER THE ISLAMIC REPUBLIC

00:00:14.862 --> 00:00:20.734
OF IRAN FIRED A SALVO OF CRUISE

00:00:20.735 --> 00:00:22.168
MISSILES INTO U.S. BASES IN

00:00:22.169 --> 00:00:22.469
IRAQ.

00:00:22.470 --> 00:00:26.406
THE PRESIDENT'S ANNOUNCED IRAN'S

00:00:26.407 --> 00:00:28.641
MISSILES HAD LANDED HARMLESSLY.

00:00:28.642 --> 00:00:31.911
TURNED OUT TO BE A PURELY

00:00:31.912 --> 00:00:33.580
SYMBOLIC BOMBING DESIGNED TO

00:00:33.581 --> 00:00:35.849
STOP RATHER THAN START A LARGER

00:00:35.850 --> 00:00:36.116
WAR.

00:00:36.117 --> 00:00:37.150
AS THE PRESIDENT EXPLAINED, AT

00:00:37.151 --> 00:00:39.252
LEAST FOR NOW, THE HOSTILITIES

00:00:39.253 --> 00:00:39.919
ARE OVER.

00:00:39.920 --> 00:00:41.588
&gt;&gt; OUR GREAT AMERICAN FORCES ARE

00:00:41.589 --> 00:00:43.623
PREPARED FOR ANYTHING.

00:00:43.624 --> 00:00:46.259
IRAN APPEARS TO BE STANDING DOWN

00:00:46.260 --> 00:00:48.962
WHICH IS A GOOD THING FOR ALL

00:00:48.963 --> 00:00:49.662
PARTIES CONCERNED AND A VERY

00:00:49.663 --> 00:00:52.799
GOOD THING FOR THE WORLD.

00:00:52.800 --> 00:00:53.967
&gt;&gt; Tucker: A VERY GOOD THING FOR

00:00:53.968 --> 00:00:54.601
THE WORLD.

00:00:54.602 --> 00:00:55.902
THAT'S A BIG CLAIM.

00:00:55.903 --> 00:00:58.404
BUT IN THIS CASE, IT IS NOT AN

00:00:58.405 --> 00:00:59.072
OVERSTATEMENT.

00:00:59.073 --> 00:01:02.208
FOR THE PAST FIVE DAYS, ALL OF

00:01:02.209 --> 00:01:04.711
US HAD HAD A CHANCE TO RUMINATE

00:01:04.712 --> 00:01:08.114
ON WHAT WAR WITH IRAN WOULD MEAN

00:01:08.115 --> 00:01:08.982
FOR US IN THE UNITED STATES.

00:01:08.983 --> 00:01:12.352
VERY EASILY, IT COULD BECOME A

00:01:12.353 --> 00:01:12.819
CATASTROPHE.

00:01:12.820 --> 00:01:16.156
WE OUGHT TO BE SAYING PRAYERS OF

00:01:16.157 --> 00:01:18.124
THANKS THAT IT DIDN'T HAPPEN.

00:01:18.125 --> 00:01:19.359
WE'RE STILL CLOSE TONIGHT.

00:01:19.360 --> 00:01:21.060
THOUSANDS OF AMERICAN TROOPS

00:01:21.061 --> 00:01:21.995
REMAIN STATIONED IN IRAQ.

00:01:21.996 --> 00:01:23.997
THAT'S A COUNTRY THAT IS LARGELY

00:01:23.998 --> 00:01:25.265
RUN BY IRAN.

00:01:25.266 --> 00:01:26.666
THINK ABOUT THAT.

00:01:26.667 --> 00:01:28.268
AFTER NEARLY 17 YEARS OF

00:01:28.269 --> 00:01:31.204
AMERICAN OCCUPATION, IRAN'S MOST

00:01:31.205 --> 00:01:32.939
POWERFUL MILITARY LEADER WAS

00:01:32.940 --> 00:01:35.108
FLYING IN AND OUT OF BAGHDAD'S

00:01:35.109 --> 00:01:37.177
AIRPORT LIKE HE OWNED IT.

00:01:37.178 --> 00:01:38.344
THAT'S HOW COMFORTABLE HE FELT

00:01:38.345 --> 00:01:39.179
IN IRAQ.

00:01:39.180 --> 00:01:41.080
A PLACE WE SUPPOSEDLY CONTROL.

00:01:41.081 --> 00:01:42.916
NOW THE GOVERNMENT OF IRAQ,

00:01:42.917 --> 00:01:44.317
NEEDED TO BE CREATED OUT OF

00:01:44.318 --> 00:01:46.519
NOTHING AND UNTOLD BILLIONS

00:01:46.520 --> 00:01:48.321
PROPPING UP MORE THAN A DECADE,

00:01:48.322 --> 00:01:50.623
IS TAKING IRAN'S SIDE IN THIS

00:01:50.624 --> 00:01:52.525
DISPUTE AND DEMANDING THAT

00:01:52.526 --> 00:01:53.493
AMERICANS LEAVE THE COUNTRY.

00:01:53.494 --> 00:01:56.830
SO 17 YEARS, TRILLIONS OF

00:01:56.831 --> 00:01:59.833
AMERICAN DOLLARS, MORE THAN

00:01:59.834 --> 00:02:02.602
35,000 AMERICANS KILLED OR

00:02:02.603 --> 00:02:04.270
WOUNDED, YOU PROBABLY KNOW ONE,

00:02:04.271 --> 00:02:06.005
AND THIS IS WHAT WE GET AT THE

00:02:06.006 --> 00:02:06.873
END IN RETURN.

00:02:06.874 --> 00:02:09.008
ANOTHER IRANIAN PROXY STATE THAT

00:02:09.009 --> 00:02:11.477
HATES US.

00:02:11.478 --> 00:02:12.011
IT'S INFEWE

00:02:12.012 --> 00:02:12.045
IT'S INFURE

00:02:12.046 --> 00:02:16.282
IT'S INFURIATING.

00:02:16.283 --> 00:02:18.818
IT'S IMMORAL.

00:02:18.819 --> 00:02:21.821
THE CASUAL RECKLESSNESS.

00:02:21.822 --> 00:02:23.590
IT'S ALL AN INSULT TO THE MEMORY

00:02:23.591 --> 00:02:25.291
OF THE THOUSANDS OF AMERICANS

00:02:25.292 --> 00:02:26.426
WHO DIED IN IRAQ.

00:02:26.427 --> 00:02:28.428
IT'S ONE OF THE SADDEST THINGS

00:02:28.429 --> 00:02:30.730
AMERICA HAS EVER DONE.

00:02:30.731 --> 00:02:33.266
THERE MAY BE AN UPSIDE TO ALL OF

00:02:33.267 --> 00:02:34.868
THIS SADNESS.

00:02:34.869 --> 00:02:36.669
IRAQ'S DEMOCRATIC ELECTED

00:02:36.670 --> 00:02:37.770
GOVERNMENT HAS ASKED US TO

00:02:37.771 --> 00:02:38.438
LEAVE, AND WE SHOULD LEAVE,

00:02:38.439 --> 00:02:40.306
IMMEDIATELY.

00:02:40.307 --> 00:02:42.775
REMAINING IN IRAQ INCREASES THE

00:02:42.776 --> 00:02:45.078
POWER OF BUREAUCRATS AND THINK

00:02:45.079 --> 00:02:45.778
TANKS IN WASHINGTON.

00:02:45.779 --> 00:02:47.113
IT DOES DO THAT.

00:02:47.114 --> 00:02:49.048
THAT'S WHY THEY'RE IN FAVOR OF

00:02:49.049 --> 00:02:49.449
IT.

00:02:49.450 --> 00:02:52.118
AS THE LAST WEEK HAS SHOWN, IT

00:02:52.119 --> 00:02:53.953
IMPERILS THE LIVES OF AMERICANS,

00:02:53.954 --> 00:02:57.156
AND FOR NO GOOD REASON.

00:02:57.157 --> 00:02:58.892
WE CAN'T TURN IRAQ INTO BELGIUM.

00:02:58.893 --> 00:02:59.726
WE TRIED THAT.

00:02:59.727 --> 00:03:01.261
IT DIDN'T WORK.

00:03:01.262 --> 00:03:02.462
IT'S NEVER GOING TO WORK.

00:03:02.463 --> 00:03:05.031
WE DON'T NEED THEIR OIL ANYMORE.

00:03:05.032 --> 00:03:06.699
WE'VE GOT FRACKING NOW.

00:03:06.700 --> 00:03:08.001
IT'S TIME TO GO.

00:03:08.002 --> 00:03:09.969
OH, BUT YOU CAN'T JUST LEAVE

00:03:09.970 --> 00:03:12.272
IRAQ SCREAM THE THINK TANKERS

00:03:12.273 --> 00:03:14.173
AND TV WAR PLANNERS.

00:03:14.174 --> 00:03:14.707
IT'S IRRESPONSIBLE.

00:03:14.708 --> 00:03:16.242
THEY MISS THE IRONY.

00:03:16.243 --> 00:03:17.210
BUT YOU CAN'T LEAVE.

00:03:17.211 --> 00:03:18.378
ACTUALLY, YOU CAN.

00:03:18.379 --> 00:03:19.579
HERE'S HOW IT'S DONE.

00:03:19.580 --> 00:03:20.680
&gt;&gt; HOW DOES THE UNITED STATES

00:03:20.681 --> 00:03:22.348
GET OUT OF THIS SITUATION?

00:03:22.349 --> 00:03:25.151
&gt;&gt; HOW DO THEY GET OUT?

00:03:25.152 --> 00:03:27.153
THEY GET OUT.

00:03:27.154 --> 00:03:28.087
DECLARE VICTORY AND LEAVE.

00:03:28.088 --> 00:03:30.423
I'LL TELL YOU, THIS COUNTRY IS

00:03:30.424 --> 00:03:32.992
JUST GOING TO GET FURTHER BOGGED

00:03:32.993 --> 00:03:33.293
DOWN.

00:03:33.294 --> 00:03:34.894
THEY'RE IN A CIVIL WAR OVER

00:03:34.895 --> 00:03:36.262
THERE, WOLF.

00:03:36.263 --> 00:03:37.196
THERE'S NOTHING WE'RE GOING TO

00:03:37.197 --> 00:03:38.898
BE ABLE TO DO WITH A CIVIL WAR.

00:03:38.899 --> 00:03:40.667
THEY ARE IN A MAJOR CIVIL WAR.

00:03:40.668 --> 00:03:42.936
IT'S GOING TO GO TO IRAN.

00:03:42.937 --> 00:03:44.570
IT'S GOING TO GO TO OTHER

00:03:44.571 --> 00:03:49.143
COUNTRIES.

